und" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Auditable document vault for customs and finance</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 15% 0%, rgb(248 208 0 / 0.14), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-start"><div><div class="mx-0 max-w-2xl"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-start"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>What you are actually buying</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Not a brochure.<!-- --> <span class="text-gradient-brand">An operating loop.</span></h2></div><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">Replace the patchwork of Excel, WhatsApp, a TMS and a finance sheet with one operating loop: quote → book → move → store → clear → invoice.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-foreground/85">Logistics OS unifies every touch point of a modern logistics business — from quotation and booking to freight movement, warehousing, customs, documentation and financial settlement — inside one connected platform. Replace disconnected spreadsheets, TMS tools and finance sheets with a single operating layer for the entire shipment lifecycle.</p></div><aside class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-replace h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1"></path><path d="M15 10a1 1 0 0 1-1-1"></path><path d="M21 4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1"></path><path d="M21 9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1"></path><path d="m3 7 3 3 3-3"></path><path d="M6 10V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg>Typically replaces</div><ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Shipment trackers in Excel</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>WhatsApp status groups</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Standalone TMS that never talks to finance</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Folder-based document dumps</li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Month-end job costing</li></ul><a class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full transition focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:size-[1.05em] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-brand-600 text-foreground font-semibold shadow-[0_10px_30px_-8px_rgb(248_208_0_/_0.7)] hover:bg-brand-400 hover:shadow-[0_18px_45px_-10px_rgb(248_208_0_/_0.85)] hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 h-12 px-6 text-base mt-6 w-full" href="/contact/?product=logistics-os#demo">Book a demo<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></aside></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 85% 100%, rgb(17 17 17 / 0.05), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Why teams switch</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">The work is already happening. It is just happening in the wrong places.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">If this list feels familiar, the product is for you. If it does not, skip it — we would rather you not buy the wrong OS.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-rose-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>Before Extraaaz</div><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-5"><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">The shipment lives in five places</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Ops has a tracker, warehouse has a spreadsheet, finance has another, and the customer is asking for a status nobody can confirm without a phone call.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Invoicing starts after the work is already done</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Someone re-enters charges from trip sheets and emails. Days slip. Disputes start. Margin is guessed at month-end.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Documents are a vault of PDFs</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">BL, AWB, packing list, shipping bill — versioned in folders, forwarded on WhatsApp, missing when customs or a customer asks.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">You cannot see which jobs actually make money</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Revenue is booked. Costs arrive later. By the time P&amp;L is built, the next 200 jobs are already moving.</p></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-brand-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50/80 to-card p-6 sm:p-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>After <!-- -->Logistics OS<!-- --> is live</div><ul class="mt-6 grid gap-5"><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">One job record, every team</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Freight, transport, warehouse, customs and finance work off the same shipment. Status is not a rumour — it is the record.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Invoice from the job, not from memory</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Charges attach as the work happens. Billing is a close-out, not a reconstruction.</p></li><li><h3 class="text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Documents sit on the job</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">House/master docs, filings and PODs live with the shipment, with versions and who approved what.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Fit</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Who this product is for — and who it is not.</h2></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Freight forwarders</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Multi-leg, multi-modal shipments with house/master documentation and customer-facing status.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Transporters &amp; fleet operators</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Trip planning, vehicle and driver assignment, POD and utilisation — without a separate dispatch sheet.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">3PL and warehouse operators</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Inward, storage, pick and dispatch tied back to the same customer job and billing.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-sm"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">In-house logistics for manufacturers</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Finished-goods movement, transporters and freight cost sitting next to production, not in a side system.</p></div></div><p class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-border bg-muted/40 px-5 py-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Not a fit: </span>Logistics OS is not a consumer courier tracker or a generic ERP with a shipping field. If you need a full accounting suite first, start with Business Operations Finance and add Logistics OS when the movement of goods is the product.</p></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 100% 20%, rgb(248 208 0 / 0.14), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>What&#x27;s in the box</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Everything Logistics OS includes.</h2><p class="mt-4